WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.838 --> 00:00:15.847
Roxy landed on a sidewalk.

2
00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:19.053
"Where am I?" She looked around.

3
00:00:19.054 --> 00:00:21.864
None of the signs were in English.

4
00:00:21.865 --> 00:00:24.584
Roxy checked the GPS on her watch.

5
00:00:24.585 --> 00:00:29.531
She gulped. "I'm on the other side of the world!

6
00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:34.725
I have to get back to Metro City before Vic Nebula disappears!"

7
00:00:34.726 --> 00:00:38.077
Roxy used her super rocket speed and shot into the air.

8
00:00:38.078 --> 00:00:42.367
Boom! Her speed created a sonic boom that shook buildings.

9
00:00:42.368 --> 00:00:44.342
Roxy gritted her teeth.

10
00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:50.129
She flew over the clouds and into space.

11
00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:54.378
She passed over the North Pole and then headed back down to Earth.

12
00:00:54.379 --> 00:00:58.998
Lakes, fields, mountains, and cities flashed by below her.

13
00:00:58.999 --> 00:01:03.653
"Yes!" Roxy cried. "There's Metro City!"

14
00:01:03.654 --> 00:01:09.216
As Roxy raced toward Metro City University, she used her x-ray vision.

15
00:01:09.217 --> 00:01:12.215
She saw Vic Nebula holding bundles of money.

16
00:01:12.216 --> 00:01:15.935
The scientist was about to step into a wormhole!

17
00:01:15.936 --> 00:01:20.401
Zoom! Roxy smashed through the wall of the lab.

18
00:01:20.402 --> 00:01:23.354
She slammed into Vic and knocked her away from the wormhole.

19
00:01:23.379 --> 00:01:25.654
"Gah!" Vic tried to run away.

20
00:01:25.655 --> 00:01:27.502
Roxy grabbed the villain's arm.

21
00:01:27.503 --> 00:01:29.851
Vic swung her arm away.

22
00:01:29.852 --> 00:01:33.131
Roxy's fingers hit buttons on the wormhole device.

23
00:01:33.132 --> 00:01:36.991
Suddenly dozens of wormholes popped open in the lab!

24
00:01:36.992 --> 00:01:39.029
Roxy leaped toward Vic.

25
00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:45.356
They tumbled through a wormhole and landed in downtown Metro City.

26
00:01:45.357 --> 00:01:47.912
Vic tried to push Roxy through another wormhole.

27
00:01:47.913 --> 00:01:51.246
Roxy grabbed her, and they fell through together.

28
00:01:51.247 --> 00:01:55.038
This time they landed in the computer center at school.

29
00:01:55.039 --> 00:01:57.581
"Rocket Girl!" Mara cried.

30
00:01:57.582 --> 00:02:01.869
"Grr!" Roxy tried again to steal the wormhole device.

31
00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:05.913
Crash! She and Vic knocked over chairs as they fought.

32
00:02:05.914 --> 00:02:12.017
They fell into another wormhole and were back in Vic's lab.

33
00:02:12.018 --> 00:02:15.339
Roxy fired her eye laser beams at the device.

34
00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:17.549
"Ouch!" Vic cried.

35
00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:19.556
The device fell from her hand.

36
00:02:19.557 --> 00:02:22.265
She stumbled backward and fell into a wormhole.

37
00:02:22.266 --> 00:02:23.765
The device hit the floor.

38
00:02:23.766 --> 00:02:28.429
Crack! Instantly all the wormholes vanished.

39
00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:32.314
Vic was gone too.

40
00:02:32.315 --> 00:02:34.832
Roxy picked up the broken device.

41
00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:37.511
"Vic can't come back without this.

42
00:02:37.512 --> 00:02:39.782
I wonder where she is now."

43
00:02:39.783 --> 00:02:41.462
She looked around the lab.

44
00:02:41.463 --> 00:02:47.678
"At least she didn't get away with the money!"

45
00:02:47.679 --> 00:02:53.922
Roxy returned to the computer center at school.

46
00:02:53.923 --> 00:02:58.281
"Did Vic Nebula help you catch the villain?" Terrell whispered.

47
00:02:58.282 --> 00:03:00.026
Roxy shook her head.

48
00:03:00.027 --> 00:03:02.819
"Vic Nebula was the villain.

49
00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:08.102
She got away, but she'll never come back." Roxy shrugged.

50
00:03:08.103 --> 00:03:11.472
"At least I have a new idea for my research project."

51
00:03:11.473 --> 00:03:14.505
"What's that?" Terrell asked.

52
00:03:14.506 --> 00:03:17.867
"Wormholes!" Roxy grinned.
